  "is_atomic": false,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "When a marshaling station is \"used\" (i.e., any positive quantity is transshipped through it), is the fixed cost f_k incurred once per planning period regardless of how much flows through it?",
    "Is the decision to open/use a station a binary choice you want the model to make (minimizing total cost = fixed + variable), or are both stations always available and the fixed costs are just additional data you want included in the objective?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains two semantically independent questions: one clarifying the timing/trigger of the fixed cost, and another clarifying whether the station usage is a binary decision variable or a fixed parameter."
}

